## Input

```css
@property #{$name} { syntax: "*"; inherits: false; }
.after-property { color: red; }
@font-palette-values #{$name} { font-family: "Bixa"; }
.after-palette { color: red; }
@position-try #{$name} { top: 0; }
.after-position { color: red; }
@custom-media #{$name} (width > 1px);
.after-media { color: red; }

@property brand { syntax: "*"; inherits: false; }
@font-palette-values theme { font-family: "Bixa"; }
@position-try corner { top: 0; }
.following { color: blue; }

```


